{
  "title": "Warm Bitter Kenyan Sweetcorn Stew",
  "description": "A traditional Kenyan dish featuring sweetcorn and dashi extract, cooked in a cataplana vessel, this stew is perfect for a midnight craving. It has a bitter and crumbly texture.",
